    Bug 11076 - Add missing functions for newsgroup messages opened from file or URI. r=mkmelin

    - Enable the "Followup" command, the "Newsgroups" and (if displayed) the "Message-ID" pop up menu, and display the "References" header for these messages.
    - Default to "Followup to Newsgroup" instead of "Reply" for all newsgroup messages.
    - When replying to standalone newsgroup messages the default identity of the first NNTP server is preselected.
    - Simplify the "Copy Newsgroup URL" function by no longer using the deprecated 'snews:' scheme (see https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5538#section-8.1).

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D235508

